{"version": 1, "pages": [{"id": "p1", "title": "1. Home · proof (before/after, paper trail, results) · cycle 3", "shapes": [{"id": "doc-title-p1", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -860, "w": 4400, "h": 200}, "text": "<p style='font-size:40pt;text-align:left'><b>Harvest concept site · Cycle 3 review (preview 9f6f8db)</b><br><span style='font-size:20pt'>Home: before/after, paper trail, results · Desktop 1440×1024 · commit 9f6f8db · https://6ace5bda91107ed2c5b1d4c2--harvest-for-lucid.netlify.app</span></p>"}, {"id": "legend-box-p1", "type": "text", "boundingBox": {"x": 0, "y": -600, "w": 2600, "h": 420}, "text": "<p style='font-size:22pt;text-align:left'><b>How to review</b><br>Leave feedback as sticky notes INSIDE the screen's frame. Start a note with <b>Do:</b>, <b>Must do</b>, <b>Try:</b> or <b>Consider:</b> to set its priority (the words win over the colour); otherwise the colour counts: <span style='color:#C62828'><b>Red = Do / Must do</b></span>, <span style='color:#9A7B00'><b>Yellow = Try</b></span>, <span style='color:#1565C0'><b>Blue = Consider</b></span>. <span style='color:#BA23F6'><b>Purple = Board format</b></span> (notes about this board's layout). Comments are read as general feedback.<br><b>Stickies show your name — stay signed in.</b></p>"}, {"id": "legend-must-p1", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 2700, "y": -530, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FF8A80"}, "stroke": {"color": "#C62828", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Red</b><br>Do / Must do</p>"}, {"id": "legend-try-p1", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3020, "y": -530, "w": 260, "h": 300}, "style": {"fill": {"type": "color", "color": "#FFE066"}, "stroke": {"color": "#9A7B00", "width": 2, "style": "solid"}}, "text": "<p style='font-size:24pt;text-align:center'><b>Yellow</b><br>Try</p>"}, {"id": "legend-maybe-p1", "type": "rectangle", "boundingBox": {"x": 3340, "y": -530, "w": 260, 